n.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,X,v\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,X,v\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8902399f82dbe8a2\" href=\"?note=8902399f82dbe8a2\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^1(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\">\\(L^1(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}\">\\(\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ec5f34b0092e1daf\" href=\"?note=ec5f34b0092e1daf\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-L1.md\">../batch16/58-df-L1.md</a>, and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2e4ee9615831113b\" href=\"?note=2e4ee9615831113b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md\">../batch16/58-df-expectation.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb3Variance}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb3Variance}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob3\\text{-}variance} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb3Variance}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,X,v)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R))\\land\nX^2\\in L^1(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\nv\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land\nv=\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}\\!\\left[\\left(X-\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}[X]\\right)^2\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob3\\text{-}variance} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb3Variance}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,X,v)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R))\\land\nX^2\\in L^1(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\nv\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land\nv=\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}\\!\\left[\\left(X-\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}[X]\\right)^2\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Borel structure, square-integrability guard, and expectation operator now have explicit upstream sources.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"8902399f82dbe8a2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable.md]]","embed"